um levels in the mitochondrial matrix through the formation of calcium-phosphate precipitates (PubMed:22015608, PubMed:29100093)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}